{"value":"{\"count\":5,\"tweets\":[{\"id\":\"2099894266633818238\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/easysbc/status/2099894266633818238\",\"handle\":\"easysbc\",\"author\":\"EasySBC\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T16:13:01.000Z\",\"timeText\":\"14h\",\"text\":\"The most Meta Wingers on FC27 ✅ \\n\\nBased on Meta Ratings 🧠 \\n\\nA couple of these cards you may be surprised to see!\",\"hasVideo\":false,\"hasPhoto\":false,\"hasCard\":false,\"domImages\":[],\"isRetweet\":false},{\"id\":\"2099858027826360771\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/easysbc/status/2099858027826360771\",\"handle\":\"easysbc\",\"author\":\"EasySBC\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T13:49:01.000Z\",\"timeText\":\"16h\",\"text\":\"Rashford will probably be very overpriced at the start of FC27 - likely one to avoid ❌ \\n\\nPedro Neto will do just as good of a job, for a fraction of the price ✅\",\"hasVideo\":false,\"hasPhoto\":false,\"hasCard\":false,\"domImages\":[],\"isRetweet\":false},{\"id\":\"2099824311129210962\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/easysbc/status/2099824311129210962\",\"handle\":\"easysbc\",\"author\":\"EasySBC\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T11:35:03.000Z\",\"timeText\":\"18h\",\"text\":\"Van Dijk got a notable downgrade for FC27 - including losing Intercept+ - but will still one of the best CBs on the game ✅ \\n\\nThere are 3 Premier League CBs with a higher Meta Rating though 👀\",\"hasVideo\":false,\"hasPhoto\":false,\"hasCard\":false,\"domImages\":[],\"isRetweet\":false},{\"id\":\"2099786807797768381\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/easysbc/status/2099786807797768381\",\"handle\":\"easysbc\",\"author\":\"EasySBC\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T09:06:01.000Z\",\"timeText\":\"21h\",\"text\":\"These are Some of the BEST Silver Cards on FC27 🚀 \\n\\nFor Silver Objectives or for Evolutions, they should be great ✅\",\"hasVideo\":false,\"hasPhoto\":false,\"hasCard\":false,\"domImages\":[],\"isRetweet\":false},{\"id\":\"2099892922652967335\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/easysbc/status/2099892922652967335\",\"handle\":\"easysbc\",\"author\":\"EasySBC\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T16:07:41.000Z\",\"timeText\":\"14h\",\"text\":\"Find more Silver Gems on our site:\\n\\n\\nhttps://\\neasysbc.io/?via=X\",\"hasVideo\":false,\"hasPhoto\":false,\"hasCard\":false,\"domImages\":[],\"isRetweet\":false}]}"}